[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6905.39, "timestamp": "01:55:05", "text": "它们基本上就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6909.35, "timestamp": "01:55:09", "text": "当魅魔互动时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6911.669, "timestamp": "01:55:11", "text": "雄性标本"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6913.99, "timestamp": "01:55:13", "text": "而雄性标本体内恶魔太多。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6917.83, "timestamp": "01:55:17", "text": "将魔力注入他体内。他要么会皈依基督教"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6919.589, "timestamp": "01:55:19", "text": "上了萨基布巴士。所以基本上他会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6922.95, "timestamp": "01:55:22", "text": "就像……基本上是怎么回事？呃……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6925.75, "timestamp": "01:55:25", "text": "鲑鱼确实喜欢雄性会变成"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6929.109, "timestamp": "01:55:29", "text": "一名女性。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6933.589, "timestamp": "01:55:33", "text": "所以要么会发生这种情况，要么……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6935.35, "timestamp": "01:55:35", "text": "呃，它会变成爱丽丝，也就是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6938.87, "timestamp": "01:55:38", "text": "基本上就是个男性魅魔"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6943.03, "timestamp": "01:55:43", "text": "如果他停下来，他就会保持这种状态。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6947.189, "timestamp": "01:55:47", "text": "不断消耗男性精华，我们……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6948.24, "timestamp": "01:55:48", "text": "说"}]